text.section:
Facilities used to conduct and support on-premises mobile casino gaming shall:

Be arranged in a manner promoting optimum security;


Include a closed circuit visual monitoring system according to specifications approved by the Department, with access on the premises to the system or its signal provided to the Department;


Not be designed in any way that might interfere with the ability of the Department to supervise on-premises mobile casino gaming operations; and


Comply in all respects with regulations of the Board pertaining thereto.
